{"path":"io/basic_ostream/flush","title":"std::basic_ostream<CharT,Traits>::flush","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::basic_ostream&lt;CharT,Traits&gt;::</span>flush","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/io/basic_ostream/flush","section":"io","kind":"page","summary":"Writes uncommitted changes to the underlying output sequence. Behaves as an UnformattedOutputFunction.","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl\">\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\"> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">basic_ostream<span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> flush<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Writes uncommitted changes to the underlying output sequence. Behaves as an <a href=\"/w/cpp/named_req/UnformattedOutputFunction\"><em class=\"t-named-req\">UnformattedOutputFunction</em></a>.\n</p><p>If <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/io/basic_ios/rdbuf\">rdbuf()</a></span> is a null pointer, the sentry object is not constructed.\n</p><p>Otherwise, after constructing and checking the sentry object, calls <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">rdbuf<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy2\">-</span><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span>pubsync<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span></span></code>. If the call returns <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"sy2\">-</span><span class=\"nu0\">1</span></span></code>, calls <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">setstate<span class=\"br0\">(</span>badbit<span class=\"br0\">)</span></span></code>.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Parameters\">Parameters</h3>\n<p>(none)\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Return_value\">Return value</h3>\n<p><code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"sy2\">*</span>this</span></code>\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Exceptions\">Exceptions</h3>\n<p>May throw <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/io/ios_base/failure\">std::ios_base::failure</a></span> if <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"br0\">(</span>exceptions<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> badbit<span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy3\">!</span><span class=\"sy1\">=</span> <span class=\"nu0\">0</span></span></code>.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Example\">Example</h3>\n<div class=\"t-example\">\n<pre data-lang=\"cpp\"><code><span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;chrono&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;iostream&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;thread&gt;</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"kw1\">using</span> <span class=\"kw1\">namespace</span> std<span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">chrono_literals</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"kw4\">void</span> f<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\"Output from thread... \"</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <span class=\"kw1\">for</span> <span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"kw4\">int</span> i<span class=\"br0\">{</span><span class=\"nu0\">1</span><span class=\"br0\">}</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span> i <span class=\"sy3\">!</span><span class=\"sy1\">=</span> <span class=\"nu0\">10</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span> <span class=\"sy2\">++</span>i<span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n        <a href=\"/w/cpp/thread/sleep_for\"><span class=\"kw2170\">std::<span class=\"me2\">this_thread</span><span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">sleep_for</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span>250ms<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n        <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> i <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">' '</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n&nbsp;\n        <span class=\"co1\">// output three numbers at once;</span>\n        <span class=\"co1\">// the effect is observable only in real-time</span>\n        <span class=\"kw1\">if</span> <span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"nu0\">0</span> <span class=\"sy1\">==</span> <span class=\"br0\">(</span>i <span class=\"sy2\">%</span> <span class=\"nu0\">3</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n            <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a>.<span class=\"me1\">flush</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <span class=\"br0\">}</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/manip/endl\"><span class=\"kw1808\">std::<span class=\"me2\">endl</span></span></a><span class=\"sy4\">;</span> <span class=\"co1\">// flushes as well</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"kw4\">int</span> main<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/thread/thread\"><span class=\"kw2167\">std::<span class=\"me2\">thread</span></span></a> tr<span class=\"br0\">{</span>f<span class=\"br0\">}</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/thread/sleep_for\"><span class=\"kw2170\">std::<span class=\"me2\">this_thread</span><span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">sleep_for</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span>150ms<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/clog\"><span class=\"kw1779\">std::<span class=\"me2\">clog</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\"Output from main<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>\"</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    tr.<span class=\"me1\">join</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span></code></pre>\n<p>Output:\n</p>\n<pre data-output=\"1\"><code>Output from main\nOutput from thread... 1 2 3 4 5 6 7 8 9</code></pre> \n</div>\n<h3 id=\"Defect_reports\">Defect reports</h3>\n<p>The following behavior-changing defect reports were applied retroactively to previously published C++ standards.\n</p>\n<table class=\"dsctable\">\n<tr>\n<th>DR\n</th>\n<th>Applied to\n</th>\n<th>Behavior as published\n</th>\n<th>Correct behavior\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cplusplus.github.io/LWG/issue581\" data-external=\"1\">LWG 581</a>\n</td>\n<td>C++98\n</td>\n<td><code>flush()</code> did not behave as an <a href=\"/w/cpp/named_req/UnformattedOutputFunction\"><em class=\"t-named-req\">UnformattedOutputFunction</em></a><br>because of the resolution of <a class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cplusplus.github.io/LWG/issue60\" data-external=\"1\">LWG issue 60</a>\n</td>\n<td>behaves as an<br><a href=\"/w/cpp/named_req/UnformattedOutputFunction\"><em class=\"t-named-req\">UnformattedOutputFunction</em></a>\n</td></tr></table>\n<h3 id=\"See_also\">See also</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/io/basic_streambuf/pubsync\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>pubsync</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  invokes <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">sync<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span></span></code> <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(public member function of <code>std::basic_streambuf&lt;CharT,Traits&gt;</code>)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/io/basic_streambuf/pubsync\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>sync</span></span></a></div><div><span class=\"t-lines\"><span><span class=\"t-cmark\">[virtual]</span></span></span></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  synchronizes the buffers with the associated character sequence <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(virtual protected member function of <code>std::basic_streambuf&lt;CharT,Traits&gt;</code>)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/io/manip/flush\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>flush</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  flushes the output stream <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(function template)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/io/manip/endl\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>endl</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  outputs <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"st0\">'<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>'</span></span></code> and flushes the output stream <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(function template)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/io/basic_istream/sync\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>sync</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  synchronizes with the underlying storage device <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(public member function of <code>std::basic_istream&lt;CharT,Traits&gt;</code>)</span> </td></tr>\n</table>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Parameters","id":"Parameters"},{"depth":3,"text":"Return value","id":"Return_value"},{"depth":3,"text":"Exceptions","id":"Exceptions"},{"depth":3,"text":"Example","id":"Example"},{"depth":3,"text":"Defect reports","id":"Defect_reports"},{"depth":3,"text":"See also","id":"See_also"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C++ reference"},{"path":"io","title":"Input/output library"},{"path":"io/basic_ostream","title":"std::basic_ostream"}],"children":[],"map":{"label":"std::basic_ostream<CharT,Traits>::flush","children":[{"label":"Declarations","note":"1 declaration. Writes uncommitted changes to the underlying output sequence."},{"label":"Parameters","note":"(none)"},{"label":"Return value","note":"*this"},{"label":"Exceptions","note":"May throw std::ios_base::failure if (exceptions() & badbit) != 0."},{"label":"Example"},{"label":"See also","children":[{"label":"pubsync","note":"invokes sync()"},{"label":"sync","note":"synchronizes the buffers with the associated character sequence"},{"label":"flush","note":"flushes the output stream"},{"label":"endl","note":"outputs '\\n' and flushes the output stream"},{"label":"sync","note":"synchronizes with the underlying storage device"}]}]},"standards":[],"wordCount":248,"codeBlockCount":2}
